---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
---
<Base title="Who we are" description="Honest Penny is an independent Alberta money-help site. Why it exists, who's behind it, and how to reach us.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Who we are</h1>
    <p>Honest Penny is a free, independent website for people in Alberta who want straight answers about money: how to cut bills, claim what they're owed from government, and save without being sold to.</p>
    <p>The UK has had sites like this for over twenty years. Canada, and Alberta in particular, has plenty of comparison sites that earn a fee when you sign up for something. We wanted one that explains your options first, including "do nothing" when that's the right answer.</p>
    <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
    <p>Honest Penny is independently owned and run in Alberta by a small editorial team. It isn't owned by a bank, utility, telecom company or comparison site, and no company can pay to be listed. Guides are written and checked by the Honest Penny team following our <a href="/editorial-code/">editorial code</a> and <a href="/how-we-check-facts/">fact-checking process</a>.</p>
    <p>We are not financial advisers, and nothing here is personal advice. We explain how the rules work, point you to the official source, and tell you what we'd check before deciding.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>. We read everything, and we can't give personal advice by email.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
